#, php-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Lingua Forge:</strong> %1$d localized template(s) from the &#8220;"
"%2$s&#8221; theme are preserved in the database but are currently inactive. "
"They will become active again if you reactivate that theme. To carry your "
"translations to the new theme, regenerate them via <strong>Settings → Lingua "
"Forge → Router → FSE scaffold</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Lingua Forge:</strong> %1$d plantilla(s) localitzada(s) del tema "
"&#8220;%2$s&#8221; es conserven a la base de dades però actualment estan "
"inactives. Tornaran a estar actives si reactives aquest tema. Per portar les "
"teves traduccions al nou tema, regenerar-les a través de <strong>"
"Configuració → Lingua Forge → Router → Fesca de FSE</strong>."

